Template: ocm/vpn_host
Type: string
Description: Public hostname or IP of this VPN server:
 Clients will connect to this address. Use the public DNS name or static IP
 that clients can reach.

Template: ocm/vpn_port
Type: string
Default: 1194
Description: OpenVPN listening port:

Template: ocm/vpn_proto
Type: select
Choices: udp, tcp
Default: udp
Description: OpenVPN protocol:

Template: ocm/http_port
Type: string
Default: 80
Description: HTTP port for the OCM web console (served by nginx):
